s_peale.JPG", "credit": "Rubens Peale", "credit_line": "The Peale Family:Creation of a Legacy 1770-1870", "license": "Public domain", "license_url": "", "attribution_required": "false", "restrictions": "", "date_created": "2013-03-29 22:32:42", "width": 1600, "height": 1056, "licensing_verified": false, "sha256": "a99da65fe3a4535544c547f9dbef798d28b78152ea4a2a383f0bcf6777a9c17c"}}, {"kind": "story", "title": "\u0631\u062c\u0639\u062a \u0644\u0628\u064a\u0626\u062a\u0647\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0635\u0644\u064a\u0629 \u0628\u0639\u062f \u063a\u064a\u0627\u0628", "body": "\u0628\u0639\u062f \u063a\u064a\u0627\u0628 \u0637\u0648\u064a\u0644 \u0639\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0634\u0647\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0637\u0628\u064a\u0639\u064a \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u062c\u0632\u064a\u0631\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629\u060c \u0627\u0644\u0646\u0639\u0627\u0645\u0629 \u062a\u0631\u062c\u0639 \u0644\u0644\u0645\u0645\u0644\u0643\u0629 \u0639\u0628\u0631 \u0645\u0634\u0627\u0631\u064a\u0639 \u0625\u0639\u0627\u062f\u0629 \u062a\u0648\u0637\u064a\u0646 \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062d\u0645\u064a\u0627\u062a\u060c \u0628\u064a\u0626\u062a\u0647\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0635\u0644\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u0627\u0637\u0642 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0641\u062a\u0648\u062d\u0629 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0635\u062d\u0631\u0627\u0648\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0644\u064a \u062a\u062a\u0644\u0627\u0621\u0645 \u0645\u0639 \u062c\u0633\u0645\u0647\u0627 \u0648\u0637\u0631\u064a\u0642\u0629 \u062d\u0631\u0643\u062a\u0647\u0627", "punch": "", "claim_ids": ["c1", "c6"], "image_query": "ostrich desert", "image": {"provider": "commons", "asset_id": "163977790", "title": "File:Ostrich Sossusvlei.jpg", "description": "An ostrich in the Namib desert, Sossusvlei, Namibia", "download_url": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bc/Ostrich_Sossusvlei.jpg/1920px-Ostrich_Sossusvlei.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "original_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bc/Ostrich_Sossusvlei.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "source_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ostrich_Sossusvlei.jpg", "credit": "Beno\u00eet Vicart", "credit_line": "Own work", "license": "CC0", "license_url": "http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en", "attribution_required": "false", "restrictions": "", "date_created": "2014-08-09 12:01:15", "width": 1600, "height": 1200, "licensing_verified": false, "sha256": "cfcc78389992039412250e99887c531d015f7294c03db965404f273b640cc507"}}]}, "feedback": "visual_review_rejected: Card 3's photo is a 19th\u2011century still\u2011life of peaches in a basket; the claimed 'ostrich egg' is a small cream\u2011colored, domed vessel tucked in the background, dominated by the peaches. It is not recognizable as an ostrich egg from the pixels alone (looks like a lidded cup/vase), so the subject is ambiguous/obscured and fails the visual\u2011identification bar for the '24 chicken eggs' claim. All other cards check out: card 1 shows a clearly identifiable live ostrich matching the size/speed facts; card 2 is Muybridge's historical motion study of a running ostrich, appropriately used to illustrate the wing/leg mechanics text, not presented as a current photo; card 4 shows a small but clearly recognizable ostrich walking across a desert dune landscape, fitting the habitat-return story. Text on every card matches the sourced claims (speed, height, weight, egg weight, wing function, reintroduction), phrasing is natural Saudi colloquial, progression from general facts to flight quirk to egg fact to reintroduction story is coherent and distinct, and the Almarai-brand light template is consistent throughout. Because of the mismatched image on card 3, the package should be rejected pending a correct ostrich-egg photo."}